        <description>&lt;p&gt;'the air is full' is an improvised musical offering by tyler felson and yours truly, with visual imagery by camilla forte, recorded live at dawn in early june at montrose harbor in chicago.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;this short collection features electric guitar, trumpet and, most importantly, the sounds of the birds just outside montrose bird point sanctuary, which guided much of our improvisation, recorded and processed with live electronics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;hugo flores garcía - guitar, electronics, mixing, mastering
tyler felson - trumpet, electronics
camilla forte - photography
birds of montrose bird point sanctuary - bird sounds&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
